        {
          "id": 1074654963,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "There's an open question on the Ask site - [How can I get wireshark to support an ISO 13400 filter for DoIP for DoIP versions 3 and 4?](https://ask.wireshark.org/question/28259/how-can-i-get-wireshark-to-support-an-iso-13400-filter-for-doip-for-doip-versions-3-and-4/) - so it would be nice to demonstrate that version 3 is decoding properly.  \n  \n\"While you're on the line ...\"  :-)  - do you have access to the `ISO 13400-2:2019/DAMD 1 DoIP Version 4` working document?",
          "author": {
            "id": 6701257,
            "username": "chuckcraft",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Chuck Craft",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
